@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Condensation-DAG analytics — canonical paths and bounded scheduling

rectangle "SccDecomposition\ncomponents · sorted condensation edges" as SCC #C3FAE8
rectangle "Validate public structure\nids · exact membership · endpoints · DAG\ncomponents <= effective cap" as VALIDATE #FFE8CC
rectangle "condensation_projection()\ncanonical forward/reverse CSR\nrepresentative -> component id" as PROJECTION #F1F3F5
rectangle "Canonical Kahn order\nmin component-id heap" as KAHN #D3F9D8
rectangle "Longest-path dynamic program\n<latex>\ell(v)=\max_{u\to v}(\ell(u)+1)</latex>\nweight = sum of SCC sizes" as DP #DBE4FF
rectangle "Level occupancy\nheight · width" as OCCUPANCY #E5DBFF

rectangle "Optional width w?" as OPTIONAL #FFF3BF
rectangle "Coffman–Graham labels\nsource-ready heap\ndescending predecessor labels" as LABELS #FCC2D7
rectangle "Reverse-label placement\nlowest non-full layer above successors" as PLACE #D3F9D8
rectangle "CgLayering\nsink layer 0 · width <= w\nedges strictly downward" as CG #C3FAE8

rectangle "CondensationMetrics\nlevels · critical path/weight\nheight · width · optional CG" as REPORT #C3FAE8
rectangle "Incomplete/capped report\nor AnalysisError for direct CG" as BOUNDED #FFE3E3

SCC --> VALIDATE
VALIDATE --> PROJECTION : valid and within cap
VALIDATE --> BOUNDED : malformed or over cap
PROJECTION --> KAHN
KAHN --> DP
DP --> OCCUPANCY
OCCUPANCY --> OPTIONAL
OPTIONAL --> LABELS : Some(w >= 1)
OPTIONAL --> REPORT : None
OPTIONAL --> BOUNDED : Some(0)
LABELS --> PLACE
PLACE --> CG
CG --> REPORT

note right of KAHN
  Every public boundary is canonical:
  component ids, adjacency, heap ties,
  path ties, and layer members.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#C3FAE8>| SCC input or immutable public result |
  |<#FFE8CC>| validation and resource policy |
  |<#F1F3F5>| shared payload-free graph projection |
  |<#D3F9D8>| directed-acyclic-graph traversal/scheduling |
  |<#DBE4FF>| longest-path recurrence |
  |<#E5DBFF>| aggregate metric |
  |<#FFF3BF>| option decision |
  |<#FCC2D7>| lexicographic Coffman–Graham labeling |
  |<#FFE3E3>| bounded or invalid outcome |
endlegend
@enduml
